graph TD
    User((User Input)) --> |Raw Text| Input[Input Processing]
    
    Input --> FE[Feature Extraction Module]
    
    subgraph Feature Extraction
        SE[Semantic Embedder<br/>SentenceTransformer]
        LF[Lexical Extractor<br/>TF-IDF Vectorizer]
    end
    
    FE --> SE
    FE --> LF
    
    SE --> |Dense Vector| TDA[Topological Engine]
    
    subgraph Topological Data Analysis
        KNN[K-Nearest Neighbors<br/>k=24]
        VR[Vietoris-Rips Persistence]
        PL[Persistence Landscape]
    end
    
    TDA --> KNN
    KNN --> |Local Point Cloud| VR
    VR --> |Persistence Diagram| PL
    
    SE --> |v_dense| Fusion[Feature Fusion Layer]
    LF --> |v_tfidf| Fusion
    PL --> |v_topo| Fusion
    
    Fusion --> |Concatenated Vector| Classifiers[Classification Module]
    
    subgraph XGBoost Classifiers
        XGB1[XGBoost - Positive]
        XGB2[XGBoost - Negative]
        XGB3[XGBoost - Neutral]
    end
    
    Classifiers --> XGB1 & XGB2 & XGB3
    
    XGB1 & XGB2 & XGB3 --> |Class Probabilities| Decision[Decision & Ambiguity Logic]
    VR --> |H1 Betti Numbers / Loops| Decision
    
    Decision --> |High Confidence| Emotion[Predicted Emotion]
    Decision --> |Low Confidence / High Loops| Ambiguous[AMBIGUOUS]
